  "content_html": "<p></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/assets/images/content/b6bf449b2fa088c98f.jpg\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/b6bf449b2fa088c98f.jpg\" /></a></div><p></p><div><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תמונה טמונה</span></h2></div><h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">על איזו מצוות 'לא תעשה' (מהפרשה), רומזת תמונת השער?</span></span></h4><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></h2></div><p></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כיצד מכונה 'עבודה זרה' בפרשה?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֱלֹהֵי מַסֵּכָה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֱלִילֵי כָּזָב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֱלִילֵי בַּרְזֶל</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֱלֹהֵי דְּמוּת</span>&nbsp;</li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מה זה אֵיפַת צֶדֶק?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אין צדק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הילה האופפת את כוכב צדק</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">משקולת מדויקת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מסירות ודייקנות</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מה זה פִּגּוּל?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עגלגל</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גל עצום</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פיגוע</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מאוס</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מה זה רכיל</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ילד רך</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">השם 'רחל' ביידיש</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סיפור רכילות</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רעל</span></li></ol></ol><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתגמים פגומים</span></h2><div><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גלו את הפתגמים והביטויים המופיעים בפרשה</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לדוגמה: הרוע נאצ = רועה צאן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>1👈 אל מתק</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">2👈 כתבמ עקעק</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">3👈 יפן&nbsp;</span></span><span face=\"Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;\">זנק</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span face=\"Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">4👈 הני קצד</span></span></span></span></p></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h2></div><div><h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 בגלל<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 חברת כימיקלים לישראל (ראשי תיבות)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 ראוי לאכילה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 חיבור אסור של 2 מינים (מהפרשה)&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 פרוע/מסוכן<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 לא מדבר<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 מילה שהוראה לא (לעשות)</span></span></p></h3><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><div><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">תמונה טמונה</span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">לפני עיור לא תיתן מכשול</span></span></p></div><div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֱלֹהֵי מַסֵּכָה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: large;\">משקולת מדויקת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מאוס</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: large;\">סיפור רכילות</span></li></ol><p></p><p></p></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פתגמים פגומים</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">לֹא תִּקֹּם</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">כְּתֹבֶת קַעֲקַע</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">פני זקן</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">הִין צֶדֶק</span></span></li></ol></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h3><h3><div></div></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי, כִי\"ל, אָכִיל, כִּלְאַיִם, אַלִּים, אִלֵּם, אַל</span></div>"
